{
  "Name": "Christmas_Shepherd",
  "$Comment": [
    "Bram the Shepherd's Christmas conversation, what he says once only Christmas runs, on his meadow in",
    "his winter clothes (his placement's Christmas entry names it in Interact). While Harvest Feast's last",
    "days still run he speaks his feast conversation instead, whose Christmas lines reach his stall and his",
    "quest list (DialogueExtensions/SeasonsOfOrbis/Christmas_Shepherd_Feast_Line.json). Bram contracts, and",
    "keeps it short: I'm, can't, they're.",
    "",
    "Start's First beats come first. The off-season beat answers a visit while Christmas is off (after a",
    "command ends it, or when a server owner stands Bram somewhere all year) with one line and goodbye. A",
    "conversation has no Season leaf, so the off-season beat and the stall line read the feature",
    "ziggfreedcommon:feature Christmas_Live, Min 1, and nobody is sent to a stall that opens closed. Then",
    "the next step's pointer, once per player (OnceId christmas_bram_next_tomas): once his part of the story",
    "is collected and Tomas's is not taken yet, he sends the player to Tomas. Collecting his quest plays",
    "this conversation again (its CompletionDialogue), so the pointer comes straight after.",
    "",
    "Quests holds two rows, both bound to him by the id he keeps in both seasons (Harvest_Feast_Shepherd).",
    "His part of Santa's story, Reindeer Food (christmas_reindeer_food): the conversation opens on its offer",
    "while it can be taken, on its brief while it is carried, and on its hand-in once the carrots are in the",
    "bag. Then his daily, Daily Carrots (christmas_daily_carrots), the same three screens. Each hand-in",
    "opens his quest list with Collect in front of the player. Otherwise it opens on greeting, the",
    "Fallback: who he is this Christmas and what his stall gives out, in plain words, with his stall, his",
    "quest list (Need a hand?), where the Present Thieves are (the thieves screen), and why he is here."
  ],
  "Start": {
    "First": [
      {
        "Node": "off_season",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 } ] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "next_tomas",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_reindeer_food", "State": "COMPLETED" },
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_gingerbread_cookies", "State": "NOT_STARTED" }
        ],
        "Once": true,
        "OnceId": "christmas_bram_next_tomas"
      }
    ],
    "Quests": {
      "christmas_reindeer_food": { "Offerable": "reindeer_offer", "Active": "reindeer_brief", "Ready": "reindeer_ready" },
      "christmas_daily_carrots": { "Offerable": "carrots_offer", "Active": "carrots_brief", "Ready": "carrots_ready" }
    },
    "Fallback": "greeting"
  },
  "Nodes": {
    "off_season": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.off_season.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.off_season.opt.farewell", "Style": "farewell", "Close": true }
      ]
    },
    "greeting": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.greeting.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.stall",
          "Style": "neutral",
          "Conditions": [
            { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 }
          ],
          "Open": { "Type": "Shop", "Shop": "Christmas_Shepherd" }
        },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.quests", "Style": "neutral", "Open": "Quests" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.thieves", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "thieves" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.why", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "why" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "thieves": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.thieves.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.thanks", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "why": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.why.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.back", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "next_tomas": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.next_tomas.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.thanks", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "reindeer_offer": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.reindeer_offer.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.reindeer_offer.opt.accept",
          "Style": "accept",
          "Do": [ { "Accept": "christmas_reindeer_food" }, { "Goto": "reindeer_brief" } ]
        },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.later", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "reindeer_brief": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.reindeer_brief.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.opt.back", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "reindeer_ready": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.reindeer_ready.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.reindeer_ready.opt.turnin",
          "Style": "turnin",
          "Conditions": [ { "Type": "ReadyToTurnIn", "Quest": "christmas_reindeer_food" } ],
          "Do": [
            { "TurnIn": "christmas_reindeer_food" },
            { "Open": { "Type": "Quests", "Highlight": "christmas_reindeer_food" } }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "carrots_offer": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_shepherd.carrots_offer.text",
      "Options": [
